00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.810
that's a pretty darn good sign.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.610
I remember sitting,

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.230
like I was only

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.530
21 when I made that
movie. I remember sitting,

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.230
