at my parents' house,

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:58.080
like reading that script and
being, and laughing out loud.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.370
And at that, like since then

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.490
I've seen that that's a good sign.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.330
