00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.070
- Oh. So good.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.810
- So, that will be fun.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.050
- And your sound is so
perfect for Christmas,

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:33.940
that's what I love about you.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.040
- I love Christmas music, so

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.930
- I love it. Anyway, so you,

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.170
you've become a crusader for
clean and healthy living.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.930
And I would, I was going to ask like,

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.100
when did that become so important to you?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.460
But I feel like every time
you're pregnant, like,

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.560
cause I've been pregnant twice,

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.150
and I never really thought about stuff,

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:49.560
until I was pregnant. I was like,

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.200
I'm responsible for these humans.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.330
- So is that when it happened for you.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.513
- Exactly when it happened.

00:03:53.513 --> 00:03:55.500
I mean, like before that, you're like,

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.030
yeah, it's fine if I eat, you know,

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.580
something that, you know, whatever

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:00.777
is made of plastic or,

00:04:00.777 --> 00:04:01.700
- This is gonna kill me.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.510
- It's fine. But when you have like,

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.280
when you're like carrying a child, like

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.500
it's so much responsibility.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.460
It's like such a heavy weight like that,

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.770
