00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.510
I never would have pictured
this necessarily, but I,

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.260
I really started looking
into the like food system

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.280
and kind of how messed up it is.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.420
Um, when I, when I was pregnant,

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.610
just realizing that like, okay, you know,

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.530
I have the resources to go and like

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.820
