to it. So I, at that time,

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.360
I started a company called Let Us Grow.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:37.030
Um, we do like hydroponic
uh gardens that are,

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.870
