00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.820
less water than traditional,
like in-ground garden.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:43.653
- That's amazing.

00:04:43.653 --> 00:04:45.350
- And then just this last year,

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.830
I co-founded a company called Merryfield,

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.300
