00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.030
but like for if you're lazy, you know,

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.970
because I was, I was like couponing,

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:57.150
And when, you know, you go to the store

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.220
