the participating brands.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:16.850
It's like a little computer thing.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:17.960
- That's awesome.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.270
- I don't know how it works, but,

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:20.103
- Yeah. (crowd laughing)

00:05:20.103 --> 00:05:20.936
- It does.

00:05:20.936 --> 00:05:23.490
- Yeah, obviously we both need
the apps. So we don't know-

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.323
- Exactly

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:25.330
- That's awesome though.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.130
- I'm not an app developer, but

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.240
- It's brilliant though.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.690
- So it's really cool and
you can shop like anywhere.

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.450
So you know, like a lot
of times you have a coupon

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.470
